# BNB Greenfield E2E Testing Configuration
#
# This file contains the environment variables needed for running
# the complete end-to-end Greenfield storage tests.
#
# Copy this to .env and modify with your actual values.
#
# For detailed setup instructions, see: docs/GREENFIELD_E2E_GUIDE.md

# ===== Greenfield Network Configuration =====
#
# Required: Testnet RPC endpoint for CreateObject transactions
GREENFIELD_RPC_URL=https://gnfd-testnet-fullnode-tendermint-us.bnbchain.org

# Required: Storage Provider endpoint for PutObject/GetObject operations
GREENFIELD_SP_HOST=gnfd-testnet-sp3.bnbchain.org

# Required: Chain ID (5600 for testnet, 1017 for mainnet)
GREENFIELD_CHAIN_ID=5600
GREENFIELD_CLI_CHAIN_ID=greenfield_5600-1

# Required: Your bucket name (create in DCellar first)
GREENFIELD_BUCKET=your-test-bucket

# Required: Private key for signing transactions (without 0x prefix)
# Export from MetaMask: Settings → Security & Privacy → Reveal Private Key
# WARNING: Use testnet keys only! Never use mainnet keys for testing.
GREENFIELD_PRIVATE_KEY=your_private_key_without_0x_prefix

# ===== Testing Configuration =====
#
# Optional: Request timeout in seconds (default: 60)
GREENFIELD_TIMEOUT=60

# Optional: Alternative SP for failover testing
GREENFIELD_SP_HOST_ALT=gnfd-testnet-sp1.bnbchain.org

# Optional: auto CreateObject via gnfd-cmd（纯参数方式）
GREENFIELD_CLI_DISABLE_HOST=1
GREENFIELD_CLI_BYPASS_SEAL=0
GREENFIELD_CREATE_OBJECT_CMD_TEMPLATE="bin/gnfd-cmd_mac --chainId {chain_id} --rpcAddr {rpc_url} {host_flag} --passwordfile {passwordfile} object put --contentType {content_type} {file} gnfd://{bucket}/{object}"

# ===== Required Setup Steps =====
#
# 1. Get Testnet BNB:
#    Visit: https://gnfd-bsc-testnet-faucet.bnbchain.org/
#    Connect your wallet and request testnet BNB
#
# 2. Create Test Bucket:
#    Visit: https://dcellar.io/ (select testnet network)
#    Click "Create Bucket"
#    - Name: Set to GREENFIELD_BUCKET above
#    - Primary SP: Select SP1 (or use GREENFIELD_SP_HOST)
#    - Visibility: "Public Read" (for testing public access)
#    - Payment Account: Your connected wallet
#
# 3. Configure Private Key:
#    In MetaMask: Settings → Security & Privacy → Reveal Private Key
#    Copy the key (remove 0x prefix if present)
#    Set as GREENFIELD_PRIVATE_KEY above
#
# 4. Verify Configuration:
#    Check that:
#    - GREENFIELD_BUCKET matches your created bucket name
#    - GREENFIELD_PRIVATE_KEY is the correct 64-char hex string
#    - Your wallet has testnet BNB for gas fees
#
# ===== Running E2E Tests =====
#
# After completing setup above:
#
# 1. Copy this file to .env:
#    cp .env.e2e.example .env
#
# 2. Run all E2E tests:
#    pytest tests/test_greenfield_e2e.py -v -m integration -s
#
# 3. Run specific test:
#    pytest tests/test_greenfield_e2e.py::TestGreenfieldE2E::test_create_and_upload_small_text -v -s -m integration
#
# 4. Run with debug output:
#    pytest tests/test_greenfield_e2e.py -v -s --log-cli-level=DEBUG -m integration
#
# ===== Expected Test Results =====
#
# All 8 E2E tests should pass:
# - Test 1: Small Text Upload & Download ✅
# - Test 2: JSON Reputation Data ✅
# - Test 3: Binary Data Integrity ✅
# - Test 4: Large Data Performance ✅
# - Test 5: Multiple Objects Workflow ✅
# - Test 6: Transaction Hash Uniqueness ✅
# - Test 7: Error Handling ✅
# - Test 8: Concurrent Operations ✅
#
# ===== Performance Expectations =====
#
# For 1MB test data:
# - Upload time: 10-60 seconds (varies by network congestion)
# - Download time: 1-10 seconds
# - Upload speed: 5-100 KB/s
# - Download speed: 50-500 KB/s
#
# ===== Troubleshooting =====
#
# If tests fail:
# 1. Check testnet BNB balance: https://greenfieldscan.com/address/YOUR_WALLET
# 2. Verify bucket exists in DCellar
# 3. Check SP status: https://greenfieldscan.com/
# 4. Wait for network propagation if needed
# 5. See GREENFIELD_E2E_GUIDE.md for detailed troubleshooting
#
# ===== References =====
#
# - DCellar: https://dcellar.io/
# - Testnet Faucet: https://gnfd-bsc-testnet-faucet.bnbchain.org/
# - Greenfield Explorer: https://greenfieldscan.com/
# - E2E Test Guide: docs/GREENFIELD_E2E_GUIDE.md
# - Greenfield Docs: https://docs.bnbchain.org/bnb-greenfield/
